 # Tsubouchi et al. (2018, JPO 48, 2029-2055), the Sep 2005 - Aug 2006 mooring-based inverse estimate.
 #
 #   julia +1.13 --project=. analysis/glorys_transports.jl [config.toml]      (once, for the GLORYS reference)
